From 4f98c3a652fcb574cdde1bb64c6cc2ce3f4a678f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 06:35:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] generic-parallel: test of a behaviour mixing tensors and
 symmetric tensors

DefaultGenericSaintVenantKirchhoffElasticity declares the deformation
gradient and the first Piola-Kirchhoff stress as a gradient and a
thermodynamic force (DefaultGenericBehaviour DSL). It multiplies the
deformation gradient by the second Piola-Kirchhoff stress, which uses a
tensor view of a symmetric tensor, and converts its tangent operator with
the tools of the finite strain behaviours. It is compared to the generic
interface for all the configurations.
